    name: null,
    body: "## What's Changed\n* perf(platform): name a foreign-model agent exec for replica cache affinity by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3490\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/tale-project/tale/compare/v0.5.56...v0.5.57",
