    body: "## What's Changed\n* feat(ai-gateway): drop the panel password, split the token endpoints by @yannickmonney in https://github.com/tale-project/tale/pull/3457\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/tale-project/tale/compare/v0.5.46...v0.5.47",
